OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fevening with lengthy clear spells for
OL,7,Fmost places, perhaps the odd light
OL,8,Fshower at first. Dry through the rest
OL,9,Fof the night with winds becoming
OL,10,Flighter.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA dry day with lengthy sunny
OL,13,Fspells between patchy amounts of
OL,14,Fcloud. More in the way of cloud for
OL,15,FUpper Tayside but still remaining dry.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,18,Fchangeable with showers or longer
OL,19,Fspells of rain on Friday, but
OL,20,Fgenerally drier on the weekend with
OL,21,Fbright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
